))

#solution(9, [In S.R. Bommai v. Union of India (1994), a nine-judge constitutional bench ruled that secularism is a fundamental feature of the basic structure, validating the dismissal of four state governments.], answer: [C])

#mcq(10, [Following the communal violence in Gujarat in 2002, the Supreme Court of India famously ordered which high-profile riot trial to be transferred outside Gujarat to Maharashtra to ensure an unbiased trial?], (
